    "text": "advancemonticellonian.com\nwebsite\nMonticello\nJunior Billies defeat Warren Junior Lumberjacks 44-30 in Warren\nBy Jeff Young - Advance Monticellonian,\n15 hours agoWith The anticipation of the Friday night contest in Monticello between the Monticello Billies and Warren Lumberjacks in the annual Union Bank Saline River Shootout, the rivalry would kickoff on Thursday night with the Monticello Junior Billies travelling to Warren to face off against the Warren Junior Lumberjacks at Jim Hurley Stadium.",
